  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Void-aspected energy encases your hand, empowering you to touch a creature and snuff its life out.</p><p>This spell takes effect if the touched creature's highest <strong>Attribute</strong> is less than or equal to <strong>1 + ES</strong>, where <strong>ES</strong> is the number of extra successes.</p><p>If the creature has <strong>Wounds</strong>, they increase by <strong>+2</strong>.</p><p>Otherwise, it dies or is knocked instantly unconscious, depending on your choice.</p>",
